WEBVTT

00:03.618 --> 00:07.334
I, uh, I keep having this dream.

00:07.418 --> 00:11.267
Where I see that guy from the
mountains who hung himself.

00:11.351 --> 00:13.468
He must've been planning to do it,

00:13.552 --> 00:16.934
so why did he tell us his story first?

00:17.018 --> 00:20.934
Couldn't say.
Doubt we'll ever know.

00:21.018 --> 00:23.934
He was probably hoping
that we'd forgive him,

00:24.018 --> 00:27.267
but after the way we abandoned Marcel,

00:27.351 --> 00:29.415
we were in no position to.

00:30.151 --> 00:33.668
I don't know if it
was forgiveness he was after.

00:33.752 --> 00:36.883
I couldn't really
tell you why, but I think

00:37.685 --> 00:40.482
he just wanted to be judged.

00:42.485 --> 00:46.849
Evening. It's been
four years, Reiner.

00:49.285 --> 00:51.734
Hey, uh... What's wrong?

00:51.818 --> 00:53.267
Mr. Kruger said
you were old friends

00:53.351 --> 00:55.601
and that he wanted to surprise you.

00:55.685 --> 00:58.334
It's true, right?
You two were friends?

00:58.418 --> 01:03.468
Yeah. And we have
a whole lot to catch up on.

01:03.552 --> 01:06.149
I don't even know where to start.

01:08.418 --> 01:09.849
It can't be.

01:11.485 --> 01:12.949
Eren.

02:58.968 --> 03:01.950
Lord Tybur. It's almost time.

03:02.033 --> 03:03.950
Thank you.

03:04.033 --> 03:05.818
My goodness!

03:05.902 --> 03:08.950
Well, well! Lady Azumabito.

03:09.033 --> 03:10.617
Come to give me a pep talk?

03:10.701 --> 03:12.950
I'm sorry to interrupt your preparations.

03:13.033 --> 03:14.950
I just wanted to see your face.

03:15.033 --> 03:16.884
It must be a haunting sight.

03:16.968 --> 03:19.550
I seem to have a
bad case of stage-fright.

03:19.634 --> 03:23.283
Fear not. You look
courageous and dignified.

03:23.367 --> 03:25.550
You are a truly brave man.

03:25.634 --> 03:27.750
My family knows that well.

03:27.834 --> 03:29.950
I'll wish you luck and take my leave.

03:30.033 --> 03:32.665
I'm glad you came by.
Thanks, Kiyomi.

03:34.033 --> 03:36.398
Sit down, Reiner.

03:37.634 --> 03:39.884
I found us good seats.

03:39.968 --> 03:43.750
You can hear everything
that happens on stage.

03:43.834 --> 03:46.750
We're right beneath
an apartment building.

03:46.834 --> 03:49.550
It's behind the stage, but still.

03:49.634 --> 03:53.484
It's full of excited families
waiting at their windows

03:53.568 --> 03:55.598
for the curtains to rise.

03:56.834 --> 03:59.532
They're all directly above us.

04:00.701 --> 04:02.818
Say, Mister Kruger.

04:02.902 --> 04:04.550
Did you cut your hand?

04:04.634 --> 04:07.632
Yeah. It's just a scratch.

04:09.033 --> 04:12.198
Reiner. Sit.

04:17.033 --> 04:19.818
So, uh, I think I should
head back to the others now.

04:19.902 --> 04:21.431
No, Falco.

04:22.634 --> 04:25.750
You should stay here and listen to us.

04:25.834 --> 04:26.684
Huh?

04:26.768 --> 04:30.432
Just... do as
he says, all right?

04:31.634 --> 04:32.699
'Kay.

04:33.834 --> 04:36.498
Now then. Let's get out of here.

04:41.634 --> 04:46.350
Hello. It's been quite
a while, Mr. Leonhart.

04:46.434 --> 04:47.949
Evening, Ms. Braun.

04:48.033 --> 04:51.265
I don't believe I've seen you
since your son came home.

04:52.634 --> 04:55.284
Speaking of which,
I hear Mr. Hoover died.

04:55.368 --> 04:56.750
In his sleep, I believe.

04:56.834 --> 04:59.350
He did. He always
used to speak of

04:59.434 --> 05:01.618
how proud he was of his son's courage.

05:01.702 --> 05:04.750
How he gave his all for Marley.

05:04.834 --> 05:06.550
I'm sure that Annie was just as brave...

05:06.634 --> 05:07.898
She's not dead.

05:10.034 --> 05:11.750
My daughter is alive.

05:11.834 --> 05:13.350
One day she'll come back.

05:13.434 --> 05:15.398
She promised me she would.

05:17.834 --> 05:20.550
To think.
We're about to declare war on

05:20.634 --> 05:23.832
what's left of Eldia from
the Eldian Internment Zone.

05:25.634 --> 05:28.550
Wow. Even General Calvi's here!

05:28.634 --> 05:29.883
Along with almost every other

05:29.967 --> 05:32.350
important Marleyan officer.

05:32.434 --> 05:35.550
The crowd's also full of
nobles and ambassadors.

05:35.634 --> 05:37.883
Not to mention
journalists from every newspaper

05:37.967 --> 05:40.350
in the world that's worth the ink.

05:40.434 --> 05:43.350
It kinda feels like we're the
center of the world, doesn't it?

05:43.434 --> 05:44.484
The Tyburs did this?

05:44.568 --> 05:46.350
Can't believe they're this powerful.

05:46.434 --> 05:49.365
Even though they're
just as Eldian as we are.

05:52.434 --> 05:53.950
I guess it's starting.

05:54.034 --> 05:57.550
Falco and Mr. Braun
haven't come back yet.

05:57.634 --> 05:59.750
Commander Magath sent me.

05:59.833 --> 06:01.898
He needs his Eldian Warriors.

06:21.434 --> 06:22.950
Why, Eren...

06:23.034 --> 06:24.950
Why come here?

06:25.034 --> 06:27.165
What do you plan to do?

06:29.434 --> 06:31.750
The exact same thing you did.

06:31.833 --> 06:34.550
No. I...

06:34.634 --> 06:38.750
As for why.
That's the same, too.

06:38.833 --> 06:41.631
I don't have a choice.
That's why.

06:47.301 --> 06:50.350
Sounds like the show's begun.

06:50.434 --> 06:51.798
We should listen.

06:54.434 --> 06:56.950
Let's pull back the veil of time.

06:57.034 --> 07:01.284
Roughly a century ago, the
Eldian Empire ruled the world

07:01.368 --> 07:03.565
through the might of its Titans.

07:05.834 --> 07:07.217
Humanity as we know it

07:07.301 --> 07:09.883
could go extinct three times over,

07:09.967 --> 07:11.750
and the body count still wouldn't match

07:11.833 --> 07:14.684
the number of lives
that Titans have stolen.

07:14.767 --> 07:17.732
Such is the legacy of the founder, Ymir.

07:24.634 --> 07:26.550
So much has been lost.

07:26.634 --> 07:29.750
Countless peoples
and cultures, wiped out.

07:29.834 --> 07:32.684
Histories crushed
underfoot with their pride.

07:32.767 --> 07:35.750
Eldia's history is all we have left.

07:35.834 --> 07:38.284
And it tells only of killing.

07:38.368 --> 07:42.484
You see, once the Eldians
ran out of foes to conquer,

07:42.568 --> 07:46.132
they began to fight amongst
themselves, vying for power.

07:47.301 --> 07:50.217
Thus began the Great Titan War,

07:50.301 --> 07:51.817
which saw eight of the Nine Titans

07:51.901 --> 07:54.883
locked in an endless cycle of bloodshed.

07:54.967 --> 07:56.883
But there was one brilliant Marleyan

07:56.967 --> 07:59.883
who saw in this chaos, a path to victory.

07:59.967 --> 08:03.484
He was the heroic paragon
we all know as Helos.

08:03.568 --> 08:05.484
Thanks to his cunning manipulations,

08:05.568 --> 08:10.817
Eldian infighting grew far
worse, and the Empire grew weak.

08:10.901 --> 08:13.950
Then, Helos joined hands
with the Tybur family,

08:14.034 --> 08:16.750
and they forced the supposedly
unbeatable King Fritz

08:16.834 --> 08:19.431
to retreat to a far-flung island.

08:22.034 --> 08:25.618
That said, he fled
with his powers intact,

08:25.701 --> 08:28.550
and his reign continued.

08:28.634 --> 08:31.550
With him, he took tens
of millions of Titans,

08:31.634 --> 08:34.499
ready to trample the
world at his command.

08:35.701 --> 08:38.350
It's believed that our world

08:38.434 --> 08:41.950
continues to exist unbroken
for one reason alone.

08:42.034 --> 08:43.683
Chance.

08:43.767 --> 08:47.284
Our scholars can field
no better explanation.

08:47.368 --> 08:49.350
In order to fight
this existential threat,

08:49.434 --> 08:52.550
my motherland, Marley, sent a
team of four Titan Warriors

08:52.634 --> 08:54.350
to take the Founder.

08:54.434 --> 08:56.350
But they were soundly beaten,

08:56.434 --> 08:58.731
and only the Armored Titan returned.

09:00.034 --> 09:01.084
It's clear now.

09:01.168 --> 09:04.350
The ancient engine of cruelty
called the Eldian Empire

09:04.434 --> 09:06.950
is alive and well today.

09:07.034 --> 09:09.484
Honestly, it makes sense.

09:09.568 --> 09:13.350
I get why you plunged my home into hell.

09:13.434 --> 09:16.883
You were on a mission
to save the world, right?

09:16.967 --> 09:18.964
So you had to.

09:19.834 --> 09:22.683
My orders are to send
you to the gate, Jaeger.

09:22.767 --> 09:24.350
All right.

09:24.434 --> 09:26.132
This way, you two.

09:29.834 --> 09:31.418
I feel like I've seen you before,

09:31.502 --> 09:33.418
but I can't quite place you.

09:33.502 --> 09:34.750
Where are you stationed?

09:34.834 --> 09:36.550
My unit's out west, near Lakua.

09:36.633 --> 09:38.683
They sent me to help bolster security.

09:38.767 --> 09:40.484
I'm not interested in
chatting with an Eldian,

09:40.568 --> 09:42.284
even if you are a Warrior.

09:42.368 --> 09:43.950
Well isn't that a shame?

09:44.034 --> 09:46.683
I'd started to take a real
liking to your beard.

09:46.767 --> 09:47.617
Oh!

09:47.701 --> 09:48.950
Pieck!

09:49.034 --> 09:50.884
It's the Panzer Unit!

09:50.968 --> 09:53.418
Thanks for all your hard work, guys!

09:53.502 --> 09:56.350
Oh, uh, honestly,
we should be thanking you.

09:56.434 --> 09:58.550
You're in a really good mood today.

09:58.633 --> 10:00.883
What are you doing? Let's go.

10:00.967 --> 10:02.017
What was that?

10:02.101 --> 10:04.950
What? Those soldiers ride
the Cart Titan into battle.

10:05.034 --> 10:07.950
I need their support, so I try
to build a bond with them.

10:08.034 --> 10:12.950
Well, no offense, but it seems
like ya did more harm than good.

10:13.034 --> 10:13.950
Hear anything?

10:14.034 --> 10:15.217
Nothing yet, sir.

10:15.301 --> 10:16.551
Everything's quiet for now.

10:16.634 --> 10:18.683
Report everything you hear to me.

10:18.767 --> 10:21.550
I don't care how
insignificant it may seem.

10:21.633 --> 10:22.731
Yes, sir.

10:23.701 --> 10:25.698
In here. Go.

10:31.567 --> 10:33.418
So, where's Commander Magath?

10:33.502 --> 10:34.831
Porco!

10:40.767 --> 10:43.817
Okay. What's going on here?

10:43.901 --> 10:46.564
Why does Vice Chief Braun seem so afraid?

10:47.301 --> 10:50.165
Mr. Kruger said they
were old friends, but...

10:52.633 --> 10:54.218
Old friends?

10:54.302 --> 10:56.950
Just how many years has he known him?

10:57.034 --> 11:00.299
If it's more than four, then...
they met on Paradis.

11:01.101 --> 11:04.218
Wait. That can't be right.

11:04.302 --> 11:07.284
Because... if it is...

11:07.368 --> 11:09.484
It can't be.

11:09.567 --> 11:10.631
Oh no.

11:17.235 --> 11:19.683
The history I just recounted

11:19.767 --> 11:22.284
to be common knowledge,
but I stand here now

11:22.368 --> 11:25.665
to inform you that it is
somewhat divorced from truth.

11:26.901 --> 11:29.351
I know this because the War Hammer

11:29.435 --> 11:33.017
isn't the only inheritance
the Tybur family bestows.

11:33.101 --> 11:35.484
We've passed down memories as well.

11:35.567 --> 11:39.217
Truths which I will now share with you.

11:39.301 --> 11:41.951
He's going off-script.
Not sure why.

11:42.035 --> 11:44.284
...the Great
Titan War was ended,

11:44.368 --> 11:48.417
not by Helos, nor by my Tybur forebears.

11:48.500 --> 11:50.417
The savior who ended the fighting,

11:50.500 --> 11:52.683
the hero who saved the world,

11:52.767 --> 11:54.665
was King Fritz himself.

11:55.634 --> 11:56.951
He was plagued by guilt

11:57.035 --> 11:59.883
over the Eldian Empire's vicious past.

11:59.967 --> 12:02.483
He'd grown weary of watching
families and countrymen

12:02.567 --> 12:03.683
torn apart by war,

12:03.767 --> 12:08.617
and he wept for Marley, a nation
under constant oppression.

12:08.701 --> 12:11.284
So when he inherited the Founding Titan,

12:11.368 --> 12:13.883
he plotted his own
downfall with the Tyburs.

12:13.967 --> 12:16.750
Together, we created
a Marleyan hero who would

12:16.834 --> 12:21.284
drive the king out.
His name: Helos.

12:21.368 --> 12:22.683
After that, King Fritz moved

12:22.767 --> 12:25.483
as many Eldians to Paradis as he could,

12:25.567 --> 12:27.883
erecting his great walls around them.

12:27.967 --> 12:29.483
He left a warning.

12:29.567 --> 12:31.351
That if anyone threatened his peace,

12:31.435 --> 12:34.617
countless Titans would be
unleashed in retaliation.

12:34.701 --> 12:38.831
However, he never intended
to make good on this threat.

12:39.567 --> 12:42.617
King Fritz made a vow renouncing war,

12:42.701 --> 12:46.418
and bound his successors
to uphold it just as he had.

12:46.501 --> 12:48.617
Thus, his ideology was passed down

12:48.701 --> 12:51.217
to each new King of the Walls,

12:51.301 --> 12:53.483
and the Titans with the
power to crush the world

12:53.567 --> 12:55.232
remained dormant.

12:56.035 --> 12:58.483
Marley didn't stop Eldia,

12:58.567 --> 13:01.683
and chance hasn't kept
the world from being crushed.

13:01.767 --> 13:04.683
It was the King of the Walls, Karl Fritz.

13:04.767 --> 13:06.865
A man who yearned for peace.

13:08.500 --> 13:11.617
That's it. That's all he wanted.

13:11.701 --> 13:14.217
He said that if Marley
grew strong someday,

13:14.301 --> 13:16.416
and came in force to shatter his peace

13:16.500 --> 13:20.550
and seize the Founding Titan,
he would accept it.

13:20.634 --> 13:23.883
He believed the sins his people
committed were so horrific

13:23.967 --> 13:26.951
that they could never be atoned for.

13:27.035 --> 13:29.217
"When the day of
retribution finally comes,

13:29.301 --> 13:32.617
I will accept it, but until then,

13:32.701 --> 13:36.550
let me enjoy this walled
paradise, free from strife.

13:36.634 --> 13:39.817
I ask for nothing but
a brief span of peace."

13:39.901 --> 13:42.431
Those were the final words
the King left us with.

13:43.767 --> 13:45.364
What does this mean?

13:46.501 --> 13:47.751
If what he's saying is true...

13:47.835 --> 13:51.417
So Marley and the Tybur family
didn't really save the world?

13:51.501 --> 13:53.617
Well, General? Your thoughts?

13:53.701 --> 13:55.417
But if the King of the Walls...

13:55.501 --> 13:56.683
Willy wouldn't lie.

13:56.767 --> 13:57.817
...that
means Paradis doesn't actually

13:57.901 --> 14:00.017
pose a threat, right?

14:00.101 --> 14:02.883
It's true. To secure
our own safety,

14:02.967 --> 14:05.217
my family joined hands with King Fritz.

14:05.301 --> 14:07.683
We became heroes to the world,

14:07.767 --> 14:10.417
while our fellow Eldians became devils.

14:10.501 --> 14:13.417
Put plainly, we Tyburs are petty thieves,

14:13.501 --> 14:16.617
growing fat on honor we did not earn.

14:16.701 --> 14:20.865
I stand before you, willingly
parting with my false glory.

14:21.701 --> 14:24.284
Because I have come to understand

14:24.367 --> 14:26.883
that the world we share
is in grave danger.

14:26.967 --> 14:28.483
Commander!

14:28.567 --> 14:30.683
The Warriors are gone,
and we haven't heard from

14:30.767 --> 14:33.017
any of the soldiers
we sent to collect them.

14:33.101 --> 14:35.417
Mobilize the reserves at once.
Track them down!

14:35.501 --> 14:36.598
Yes, sir!

14:38.701 --> 14:40.431
Looks like it's begun.

14:42.101 --> 14:45.017
Shit. That really hurt.

14:45.101 --> 14:47.417
What the hell is this place?

14:47.501 --> 14:50.617
Looks like a pit meant
to detain Warriors like us.

14:50.701 --> 14:51.817
It's a classic.

14:51.901 --> 14:54.617
The space is too cramped to transform in,

14:54.701 --> 14:56.284
and with two of us down here...

14:56.367 --> 14:57.550
Hmm, got it.

14:57.634 --> 14:59.417
We'd just crush each other.

14:59.501 --> 15:01.017
I'm still confused though.

15:01.101 --> 15:02.617
What's that soldier's plan?

15:02.701 --> 15:04.417
Couldn't tell you.

15:04.501 --> 15:08.032
They really were familiar,
though. I know that much.

15:12.501 --> 15:14.483
Please stay and watch.

15:14.567 --> 15:16.232
This is my atonement.

15:20.101 --> 15:23.751
With the Founder's might,
King Fritz erected three walls,

15:23.835 --> 15:26.817
using a great host of Colossal Titans.

15:26.901 --> 15:29.417
Counted together,
the walls surely contain

15:29.501 --> 15:32.017
tens of millions of Colossal Titans.

15:32.101 --> 15:36.683
They guard the king's peace
as his shield and his spear.

15:36.767 --> 15:41.483
Or they did, but now that peace
is being threatened from within.

15:41.567 --> 15:44.483
An uprising has taken place on Paradis.

15:44.567 --> 15:45.883
The King has been deposed.

15:45.967 --> 15:48.283
The Founding Titan: Stolen.

15:48.367 --> 15:51.683
The thief is an enemy to
every man, woman, and child

15:51.767 --> 15:53.617
outside of his island.

15:53.701 --> 15:55.483
An enemy of peace.

15:55.567 --> 15:58.798
His name... is Eren Jaeger!

16:01.701 --> 16:03.883
You tricked me.

16:03.967 --> 16:07.483
After what you said, I respected you.

16:07.567 --> 16:10.283
But you were just using me.

16:10.367 --> 16:12.683
Yeah, I was. I'm sorry.

16:12.767 --> 16:14.698
I did it 'cause I needed your help.

16:17.367 --> 16:18.350
The letters you had me send

16:18.434 --> 16:20.417
from outside the internment zone.

16:20.501 --> 16:21.564
Who were they to?

16:24.701 --> 16:28.417
I can't say the letters
made it to my family, but

16:28.501 --> 16:30.483
they reached my comrades.

16:30.567 --> 16:35.283
But I... I didn't know.

16:35.367 --> 16:38.883
Wait. You wrote your comrades?

16:38.967 --> 16:41.350
If the Colossi of
Paradis are ordered to walk,

16:41.434 --> 16:43.883
the rumbling will be
felt across the earth,

16:43.967 --> 16:45.751
and death will follow.

16:45.835 --> 16:48.283
Until now, only royalty has had the power

16:48.367 --> 16:49.751
to wield the Founding Titan,

16:49.835 --> 16:53.617
and King Fritz' vow has kept
his descendants from using it.

16:53.701 --> 16:56.683
But this Eren Jaeger
has found a way to use

16:56.767 --> 16:59.283
the Founder without having royal blood.

16:59.367 --> 17:02.883
Which means he could begin
the rumbling at any moment.

17:02.967 --> 17:05.551
Once the walls of Paradis begin to walk,

17:05.635 --> 17:07.817
there will be nothing we can do

17:07.901 --> 17:12.350
except flee in vain from
the sound of earthshaking steps

17:12.434 --> 17:14.350
that will herald our doom.

17:14.434 --> 17:16.417
These monsters will crush every city,

17:16.501 --> 17:18.817
trample every tree and flower.

17:18.901 --> 17:22.283
They will literally flatten our world.

17:22.367 --> 17:24.417
He's exactly right.

17:24.501 --> 17:26.751
I'm the bad guy Willy says I am.

17:26.835 --> 17:28.817
If nobody stops me,

17:28.901 --> 17:32.283
there's a chance that
I'll destroy your whole world.

17:32.367 --> 17:37.017
But to my eyes, you looked
like the bad guys, too.

17:37.101 --> 17:40.483
That day, when you breached the wall.

17:40.567 --> 17:43.350
When Titans destroyed my home.

17:43.434 --> 17:45.764
When I watched as my mom was eaten.

17:47.301 --> 17:51.617
I couldn't
understand it. Why, Reiner?

17:51.701 --> 17:55.364
Tell me why my mom was eaten by a Titan.

17:56.035 --> 18:01.217
It's because we broke the wall
that was protecting her.

18:01.301 --> 18:03.532
Why did you break the wall?

18:04.968 --> 18:07.884
So we could use the chaos to sneak in,

18:07.968 --> 18:10.884
and to find out if the king would react.

18:10.968 --> 18:12.884
But what was your mission?

18:12.968 --> 18:16.683
To save the world by taking the Founder.

18:16.767 --> 18:18.551
Well that's that.

18:18.635 --> 18:21.617
If all that was to save the world, then

18:21.701 --> 18:23.799
you didn't have much choice.

18:27.501 --> 18:29.884
I remember what you said.

18:29.968 --> 18:34.683
You promised we'd pay for what
we did and you promised pain.

18:34.767 --> 18:37.283
So are you here to make me pay?

18:37.367 --> 18:40.884
Yeah. I did say that, didn't I?

18:40.968 --> 18:42.283
Huh?

18:42.367 --> 18:44.483
Let's forget about that.

18:44.567 --> 18:47.417
At first, I considered every person

18:47.501 --> 18:49.884
on this side of the sea an enemy.

18:49.968 --> 18:54.751
But later, I crossed the sea
and slept under my enemy's roof.

18:54.835 --> 18:56.832
Ate the food they offered me.

18:58.367 --> 19:01.331
Reiner. I'm the same as you.

19:02.234 --> 19:04.884
Some of these people are awful.

19:04.968 --> 19:06.698
But some are good.

19:08.635 --> 19:10.417
Same where I'm from.

19:10.501 --> 19:14.483
Inside the walls, we're all just people.

19:14.567 --> 19:16.617
But you were taught that
the people in the walls

19:16.701 --> 19:19.951
weren't like you, that we were demons.

19:20.034 --> 19:22.617
You were just kids who got brainwashed.

19:22.701 --> 19:25.684
Hatred was part of your training.

19:25.768 --> 19:30.483
As young as you were,
how could you have fought that?

19:30.567 --> 19:33.350
You couldn't have, and well it...

19:33.434 --> 19:35.832
It looks like you've already paid.

19:38.701 --> 19:41.765
No! You're wrong, Eren!

19:42.968 --> 19:44.417
That day...

19:44.501 --> 19:45.951
When the Titan got Marcel,

19:46.034 --> 19:48.617
Annie and Bertholdt wanted to
end the mission right then.

19:48.701 --> 19:49.765
And they would've.

19:51.901 --> 19:55.351
But I convinced them to keep going.

19:55.435 --> 19:58.684
Not just to save my own skin, but...

19:58.768 --> 20:01.617
Because I wanted to become a hero!

20:01.701 --> 20:03.632
I wanted to be respected.

20:04.767 --> 20:06.231
It's my fault!

20:07.167 --> 20:10.016
The... The truth is your
mother was eaten by a Titan

20:10.100 --> 20:11.817
because of me!

20:11.901 --> 20:14.483
I have always hated my blood.

20:14.567 --> 20:16.283
And more than anyone,

20:16.367 --> 20:19.483
I have wished that
my race would disappear.

20:19.567 --> 20:21.683
I can't take this anymore.

20:21.767 --> 20:24.683
Please. Just kill me.

20:24.767 --> 20:28.283
However, I confess that I want to live.

20:28.367 --> 20:29.483
That despite everything,

20:29.567 --> 20:33.884
I believe this world is my
birthright, just as it is yours.

20:33.967 --> 20:36.683
The people gathered here
may belong to different races,

20:36.767 --> 20:39.884
different nations, but if
we're to survive this crisis

20:39.967 --> 20:44.483
then for the first time in
history, we must join as one.

20:44.567 --> 20:46.483
So please.

20:46.567 --> 20:48.817
If you wish to live,
then lend me your strength.

20:48.901 --> 20:52.298
Help me protect our world's future!

20:54.967 --> 20:58.483
If we work together,
we can overcome any obstacle.

20:58.567 --> 21:00.165
Any threat!

21:02.835 --> 21:07.483
I was right.
I am the same as you.

21:07.567 --> 21:08.817
Huh?

21:08.901 --> 21:10.283
I ask each of you to join me

21:10.367 --> 21:11.684
as I go to fight the devils

21:11.768 --> 21:13.617
who would plunge our world into hell.

21:13.701 --> 21:16.417
Help me defeat them!

21:16.501 --> 21:19.684
I think maybe we were born this way.

21:19.768 --> 21:20.617
Here and now,

21:20.701 --> 21:22.884
as a representative of
Marley's government,

21:22.967 --> 21:26.417
I send this message
to the devils of Paradis.

21:26.501 --> 21:29.283
I'll just keep moving forward.

21:29.367 --> 21:30.217
Huh...?

21:30.301 --> 21:32.732
Till I've killed my enemies.

21:40.101 --> 21:42.351
Consider this

21:42.435 --> 21:44.298
a declaration of war!

23:40.305 --> 23:43.353
The Attack Titan appears out of nowhere,

23:43.437 --> 23:47.887
roaring like a demon as it kills
enemies and innocents alike.

23:47.971 --> 23:51.753
To stop Eren's rampage,
the War Hammer swings.

23:51.837 --> 23:54.768
Next episode:
"The War Hammer Titan."
